<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23521" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾰσύν-ω</span></b> , pf.
		
			Pass.
		, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδάσυμμαι</span> or <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-υσμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					172
				</span></i>
			: inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ύνθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Adam.
					<u>Phgn.</u>
					2.26
				</span></i>
			:—<i>make rough</i> or <i>hairy,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὰς ἀλωπεκίας</span>
			<i>bring back the hair on</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				12.22.12
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>become</i> or <i>be hairy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.8.32
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαλακρόομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				518b27
			</span></i>; <i>become bushy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.6.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make thick and cloudy, overcast,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vent.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sign.</u>
				36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>aspirate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Trypho
				<u>Fr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				12.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Seleuc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.398a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of urine, <i>become cloudy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.95
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of breathing,
				<i>become rapid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Agathin.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.7.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the voice,
				<i>become hoarse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.80
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
